circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z\"></path></svg><span>Layanan Spesial Custom Brand</span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Bisa Custom Desain Logo Sendiri. Minimal 25 Pcs.</h2><p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Cantumkan logo brand, warna identitas toko, serta nomor meja unik (*Meja 01, Meja 02, dst.*). Hasil cetak tajam, tahan air, dan awet.</p><div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-cyan-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Kirim file logo toko (PNG/PDF/Canva), kami siapkan preview 3D gratis.</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-cyan-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Bisa cetak penomoran meja yang berbeda di setiap kartu.</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-cyan-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Setiap kartu sudah lengkap dengan stand akrilik bening siap pasang.</span></div></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/6289654728249?text=Halo%20Admin%20Ony%2C%20saya%20ingin%20order%20Custom%20Desain%20Kartu%20Google%20Review%20minimal%2025%20pcs%20dengan%20logo%20toko%20saya.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold transition-all shadow-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg><span>Konsultasi Desain via WhatsApp</span></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700/80 max-w-sm w-full space-y-4 text-center\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-400/20 text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-1\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white\">Alur Order Custom:</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Hanya 3 langkah sederhana</p></div><div class=\"text-left text-xs space-y-3 pt-2 text-slate-300\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5\">1</span><span>Kirim materi logo via WhatsApp</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5\">2</span><span>Review &amp; ACC mockup digital</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-700 text-cyan-300 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5\">3</span><span>Produksi 2-3 hari &amp; dikirim ke lokasi</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cara-kerja\" class=\"py-20 md:py-24 px-5 sm:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto scroll-mt-12\"><div class=\"text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-14 space-y-2\"><div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">Praktis &amp; Fleksibel</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Aktivasi Cepat &amp; Bebas Ganti Link</h2><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm\">Bisa diaktivasi manual dalam hitungan detik, dan link bisa diubah kapan saja di Dashboard Ony.</p></div><div id=\"tutorial-video\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mb-12\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white p-5 sm:p-7 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl overflow-hidden space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-slate-800\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-play\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white\">Video Tutorial Aktivasi &amp; Penggunaan</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">Putar video di bawah untuk melihat proses aktivasi kartu dan pengaturan link Google Maps.</p></div></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-semibold self-start sm:self-auto\">Video Tutorial MP4</span></div><div class=\"relative aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-black flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-800\"><video src=\"https://file.legalpilar.id/file/ccgnimex/tutorial.mp4\" controls=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain\">Browser Anda tidak mendukung pemutaran video HTML5.</video></div></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Tap / Scan Kartu</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Dekatkan HP ke sensor NFC atau scan QR code di kartu. Halaman aktivasi otomatis terbuka.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Tempel Link Ulasan</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Masukkan URL Google Maps ulasan toko Anda lalu klik aktifkan. Aktivasi bisa dilakukan manual.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-3\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">Siap Dipajang di Meja</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Pasang kartu pada stand akrilik bening di meja kasir. Pelanggan tinggal tap untuk review!</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"space-y-1 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings\"><path d=\"M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> Disediakan Dashboard Kartu yang Diatur</div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900\">Toko pindah atau link Google Maps berganti?</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 max-w-lg\">Tidak perlu beli kartu baru. Cukup login ke Dashboard Ony dan update URL baru kapan saja seumur hidup secara gratis.</p></div><a class=\"px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-semibold shrink-0 transition-colors\" href=\"/dashboard\">Buka Dashboard Ony</a></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 bg-slate-50/70 border-t border-slate-100 px-5 sm:px-8 scroll-mt-12\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-1\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Pertanyaan Umum</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Hal-hal yang sering ditanyakan seputar kartu Google Review.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 overflow-hidden transition-all\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-emerald-700\"><span>Berapa harga grosir dan apa saja yang didapat?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-slate-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 overflow-hidden transition-all\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-emerald-700\"><span>Kenapa beli via WhatsApp lebih murah daripada marketplace?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-slate-400 shrink-0\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 overflow-hidden transition-all\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full p-4 sm:p-5 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-emerald-700\"><span>Bagaimana syarat custom desain logo sendiri?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-slate-400 shrink